WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:09.520
a dark day.

2
00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.401
The sky is gray.

3
00:00:12.201 --> 00:00:13.722
And the air is cool.

4
00:00:14.542 --> 00:00:15.803
Not much to do.

5
00:00:16.663 --> 00:00:18.024
It's the end of winter.

6
00:00:19.484 --> 00:00:20.785
It's a gloomy day.

7
00:00:21.485 --> 00:00:23.366
The snow is melting away.

8
00:00:24.266 --> 00:00:26.087
The trees have no leaves.

9
00:00:26.907 --> 00:00:28.068
Not much to see.

10
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.461
It's the end of winter.

11
00:00:31.762 --> 00:00:33.162
It's a slow day.

12
00:00:33.883 --> 00:00:35.664
The butterflies are away.

13
00:00:36.484 --> 00:00:38.325
The animals are inside.

14
00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:40.486
Nature is hiding.

15
00:00:41.347 --> 00:00:42.788
It's the end of winter.

16
00:00:44.409 --> 00:00:45.809
It's a boring day.

17
00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:49.091
There are no kids outside at play.

18
00:00:50.012 --> 00:00:52.133
My bike and ball are packed.

19
00:00:52.953 --> 00:00:55.175
My tent and rope are stacked.

20
00:00:55.995 --> 00:00:57.376
It's the end of winter.

21
00:00:58.912 --> 00:00:59.792
But soon!

22
00:01:01.573 --> 00:01:03.474
It will be a bright day.

23
00:01:04.054 --> 00:01:05.955
The sun will shine its rays.

24
00:01:06.695 --> 00:01:08.656
And the air will warm our hearts.

25
00:01:09.516 --> 00:01:11.757
There'll be lots of games to start.

26
00:01:12.518 --> 00:01:13.838
It will be spring.

27
00:01:15.419 --> 00:01:17.179
It will be a happy day.

28
00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:20.561
The grass will be green and straight.

29
00:01:21.341 --> 00:01:23.742
The trees will get fresh new blooms.

30
00:01:24.703 --> 00:01:26.283
There'll be lots to do.

31
00:01:26.903 --> 00:01:28.044
It will be spring.

32
00:01:29.712 --> 00:01:31.353
It will be a busy day.

33
00:01:31.973 --> 00:01:34.733
The butterflies will dance and sway.

34
00:01:35.534 --> 00:01:37.314
The animals will be running.

35
00:01:38.114 --> 00:01:39.715
Nature will be stunning.

36
00:01:40.435 --> 00:01:41.655
It will be spring.

37
00:01:43.196 --> 00:01:44.856
It will be a fun day.

38
00:01:44.876 --> 00:01:48.317
I will ride my bike a long way.

39
00:01:48.337 --> 00:01:51.058
I will jump rope with my friends.

40
00:01:51.938 --> 00:01:55.419
We will play outside until the day ends.

41
00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.240
It will be spring.

42
00:01:59.137 --> 00:02:00.700
I will be very happy.

43
00:02:01.542 --> 00:02:03.125
It makes me want to sing.

44
00:02:03.987 --> 00:02:07.835
But for now, I can only dream of spring.
